#X msg 270 425 bipolar 1;
#X msg 356 425 bipolar 0;
#X text 60 15 curve-editor as a waveshaper;
#X text 60 460 The curve redraws a 110 Hz sine as a new waveform.;
#X text 60 478 Signal from -1 to 1 reads the array left to right.;
#X text 60 496 The 0 to 1 output is recentred to -1 to 1 for the speaker.;
#X text 60 520 Segment 2 is positive. Bipolar unlocks negative segment 1.;
#X text 60 538 The preset is gentle saturation. Types retain their own bends.;
#X msg 400 275 type 2 tension;
#X msg 530 275 type 2 linear;
#X msg 660 275 type 2 square;
#X msg 400 299 type 2 triangle;
#X msg 530 299 type 2 sine;
#X msg 660 299 type 2 stairs;
#X msg 400 325 bend 2 0;
#X msg 530 325 bend 2 0.5;
#X msg 660 325 bend 2 1;
#X obj 60 570 declare -path ../src;
#X text 400 350 Types and bend target positive segment 2.;
